; Anomaly Coop - Quick Melee strike (quickdraw.script of G.A.M.M.A. Close Quarter Combat / Gunslinger Knives Quick
; Melee): the local player's key press plays a knife animation. Read after every coop_route*.ltx (coop_route.ltx
; explains the order), so it wins over the generated coop_route_gamma.ltx.
;
; quickdraw creates a temporary animation item in the player's own hands (alife():create with the player's actor as
; the parent, slot 14) and releases it 350 ms later, so the generator made it host (Ruling F2-29). It is nothing but
; the player's own HUD animation: actor_on_update drives the state machine, on_key_press starts it, and
; perk_based_artefacts (owner) calls into it. Host-only, a client never saw the strike. Owner.
;
; World calls on a client (call router, F2 T12): the create has the own actor as the parent, so it is a request to
; the host (the item arrives when the answer does; the script ignores the return value and waits for slot 14 to fill);
; the release is the own item, a request too. An answer that never comes leaves anm_state at 1 until the next slot
; check resets it, no error.

[route_scripts]
quickdraw = owner
